# Handbook

- `internal_docs/` is authoritative. `SPEC.md` / `CONSTRAINTS.md` are non-normative bridges.
- Do not add a second tree under `/docs/`.
- Architecture changes: update the Decision Register or gap analysis in the same work. Surface handbook vs code conflicts; do not paper over them.
- Former ADR ids map through `internal_docs/Appendix/Archived-ADR-to-DR-Map.md`.
